<title>INDIA: INDIA SBI GILTS QUOTES ON GOVT SECURITIES-AUG 13.</title>
<headline>INDIA SBI GILTS QUOTES ON GOVT SECURITIES-AUG 13.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
